### 3. **DESIGN.DESELECT_PIECE** Handler

**Location:** [semio/sketchpad/sketchpad/Design.tsx](semio/sketchpad/sketchpad/Design.tsx#L1505-L1511)

**Handler Details:**
```typescript
// Lines 1505-1511
registerEventHandler("DESIGN.DESELECT_PIECE", {
  action: (context: any, event: any) => {
    const key = `${event.kitGuid}:${event.designGuid}`;
    const app = context.designApps[key] || createDefaultDesignAppState();
    const pieces = (app.selection?.pieces || []).filter((p: Guid) => p !== event.pieceGuid);
    return { designApps: { ...context.designApps, [key]: { ...app, selection: { ...app.selection, pieces } } } };
  },
});
```

**Key Characteristics:**
- **Subtractive operation**: Removes a piece GUID from the selection
- **Immutable update**: Creates new array without the target pieceGuid
- **Partial update**: Only modifies pieces array, preserves other selection properties
- **Safe on mismatch**: If pieceGuid doesn't exist, returns unchanged array

